{"id":"630272","name":"蛋炒饭","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/630272/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"剩米饭","amount":"一碗"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"火腿肠","amount":"一根"},{"name":"辣菜梗","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"少许"},{"name":"老抽","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好食材。","img":"images/630272/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"火腿肠、辣菜梗、葱都切成末。","img":"images/630272/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"蛋黄加入剩米饭中。","img":"images/630272/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/630272/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"起锅烧油。","img":"images/630272/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"油七成热时，下入蛋白快速翻炒均匀。","img":"images/630272/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入拌好蛋黄的米饭翻炒均匀。","img":"images/630272/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入菜梗末和火腿肠末，翻炒均匀。","img":"images/630272/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加少许盐和老抽翻炒均匀，加入鸡精调味。","img":"images/630272/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"最后加入葱花翻炒均匀即可出锅了。","img":"images/630272/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"起锅装盘。","img":"images/630272/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"好了。","img":"images/630272/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}